# Windows of rows whose datetimes are in the old time zone convention, by date_created as stored.
# One row per location: a location name, uuid or id, then from (inclusive, may be blank) and before (exclusive),
# as yyyy-MM-dd[ HH:mm[:ss]]. Patients seen at an unlisted location are left alone. A * row is the window for
# patients seen at no location. Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# Tip: set from after any bulk import whose times already follow the new convention.
location,from,before
Main Clinic,2021-02-04,2023-09-26
Outpatient Ward,,2023-05-01
*,,2023-05-01
